    "descriptionZh": "手工挑选的网站设计集，每条配该站首屏截图和一个 Visit Website 外链，另有 Site of the Week 与 Team's Pick 两种编辑标记。分类只按 Agency、Fashion、Portfolio 这类行业切。",
    "takeawayZh": "按行业翻整站截图，看当期 Site of the Week",
    "noteZh": "首屏左边一句话 Browse a curated collection of websites from the internet, thoughtfully picked for their design and functionality.，右边直接放当周的 Site of the Week：S.S.K. (LABS) 的两张商品图卡片，底部一条灰底 Site of the Week 标签。下面一排分类标签是 Agency、Beauty & Self-care、E-commerce、Fashion、Food & Drink、Home & Living、Media & Publishing、Portfolio、Technology。网格里每张卡是一个站的完整首屏，卡片下标注站名与时间，比如 Yale School of Art 8h ago、BASE-K 4d ago，带 Team's Pick 的条目会多一个灰底标签。",
